{
  "description": "wait-until fails with a catchable Timeout when the next wait would exceed :within.",
  "program": "(match (attempt (wait-until {:within 10s :every 5s} (fn [s] (= s \"done\")) (call job.state {:id \"j\"}))) (ok s) s (err e) (match (get e :kind) Timeout \"gave up\" _ \"other\"))",
